+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+To show the loaded application's configuration as JSON, use the :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. Values of any key containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN`` or ``KEY`` are masked as ``"***"``. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "ENV": "production",
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      "TESTING": false
+    }
+
+
